{"id": "j1-tr-1", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J1", "question": "Taksim'e 20 dakika sonra varıyorum, yakınında hangi otoparkta yer var?", "expected_tools": ["places_resolve", "ispark_find_parking"], "calls": [{"tool": "places_resolve", "args": {"query": "Taksim"}}, {"tool": "ispark_find_parking", "args": {"place": "Taksim Meydanı", "radius_km": 1.5, "min_free": 1, "with_tariff": false}}], "expected_fields": ["places_resolve.data.matches[].name", "places_resolve.data.matches[].lat", "places_resolve.data.matches[].lon", "ispark_find_parking.data.near", "ispark_find_parking.data.radius_km", "ispark_find_parking.data.count", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].name", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].empty", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].distance_km", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].is_open", "?ispark_find_parking.note"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Kanonik J1. Otoparklar 1,5 km dışına düşerse araç bunu not alanında söylemeli; cevabın 'yürüme mesafesi' iddiası distance_km'ye dayanmalı."}
{"id": "j1-en-1", "lang": "en", "journey": "J1", "question": "I am driving to Beşiktaş in 20 minutes — where can I park within 2 km, and how many spaces are free?", "expected_tools": ["places_resolve", "ispark_find_parking"], "calls": [{"tool": "places_resolve", "args": {"query": "Beşiktaş"}}, {"tool": "ispark_find_parking", "args": {"place": "Beşiktaş İskele", "radius_km": 2.0, "min_free": 1, "with_tariff": false}}], "expected_fields": ["places_resolve.data.matches[].lat", "ispark_find_parking.data.count", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].name", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].empty", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].capacity", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].distance_km", "?ispark_find_parking.note"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "English answer over Turkish source data: park names stay in Turkish, the free-space count must match the tool exactly."}
{"id": "j1-tr-2", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J1", "question": "Ümraniye'de 15 Temmuz Şehitler Meydanı otoparkının saatlik ücreti ve aylık abonelik bedeli ne kadar?", "expected_tools": ["ispark_find_parking"], "calls": [{"tool": "ispark_find_parking", "args": {"place": "Ümraniye", "radius_km": 2.0, "min_free": 1, "with_tariff": true}}], "expected_fields": ["ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].name", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].capacity", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].empty", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[?].tariff", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[?].monthly_fee", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[?].address"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Tarife metni ParkDetay'dan geldiği gibi aktarılmalı, yeniden hesaplanmamalı; ParkDetay yalnızca en yakın 3 otopark için çağrılır."}
{"id": "j1-en-2", "lang": "en", "journey": "J1", "question": "How full is the 15 Temmuz Şehitler Meydanı car park usually at 6pm on a Tuesday?", "expected_tools": ["ispark_typical_occupancy"], "calls": [{"tool": "ispark_typical_occupancy", "args": {"park_id": 3068, "weekday": 1, "hour": 18}}], "expected_fields": ["ispark_typical_occupancy.data.available == false", "ispark_typical_occupancy.data.park_id", "ispark_typical_occupancy.data.window", "ispark_typical_occupancy.data.samples", "ispark_typical_occupancy.data.note"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "answer_must_contain_any": ["yeterli geçmiş yok", "yeterli veri", "veri yok", "henüz", "not enough", "no history", "not available"], "notes": "Honest 'not available' case. İBB publishes no occupancy history, so the profile comes from this project's own snapshots; until the collector has 3+ observations the tool must say so. This expectation flips to available == true once history exists — the runner will report the mismatch rather than hide it."}
{"id": "j1-tr-3", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J1", "question": "Şu an İstanbul trafiği nasıl, Levent'te boş otopark var mı?", "expected_tools": ["traffic_index", "ispark_find_parking"], "calls": [{"tool": "traffic_index", "args": {"window": "now"}}, {"tool": "ispark_find_parking", "args": {"place": "Levent", "radius_km": 1.5, "min_free": 1, "with_tariff": false}}], "expected_fields": ["traffic_index.data.index", "traffic_index.data.at", "traffic_index.data.description", "ispark_find_parking.data.count", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].empty", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks[].distance_km"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Çapraz yolculuk (PLAN §1, J5). Trafik indeksi 1-99 arası; cevapta ölçeğin ne olduğu söylenmeli."}
{"id": "j1-en-3", "lang": "en", "journey": "J1", "question": "Is there an İSPARK car park with free spaces on Büyükada?", "expected_tools": ["places_resolve", "ispark_find_parking"], "calls": [{"tool": "places_resolve", "args": {"query": "Büyükada"}}, {"tool": "ispark_find_parking", "args": {"place": "Büyükada", "radius_km": 1.5, "min_free": 1, "with_tariff": false}}], "expected_fields": ["places_resolve.data.matches[].lat", "ispark_find_parking.data.count == 0", "ispark_find_parking.data.parks", "ispark_find_parking.note"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Negative case: the Princes' Islands have no İSPARK lot, and the search widens to 3x the radius before giving up. The honest answer is 'none found', never the nearest mainland car park presented as if it were on the island."}
{"id": "j2-tr-1", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J2", "question": "500T hattında şu anda kaç otobüs var ve neredeler?", "expected_tools": ["iett_line_buses"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_line_buses", "args": {"line_code": "500T"}}], "expected_fields": ["iett_line_buses.data.line_code", "iett_line_buses.data.count", "iett_line_buses.data.directions", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].door_no", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].lat", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].lon", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].reported_at", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[?].direction", "iett_line_buses.provenance.reported_at", "iett_line_buses.provenance.source_url"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Gizlilik testi de bu senaryoda: yanıtta plaka alanı olmamalı, araçlar yalnızca kapı numarasıyla anılmalı (NOTICE.md)."}
{"id": "j2-en-1", "lang": "en", "journey": "J2", "question": "When is the next 500T due at Kavacık Köprüsü?", "expected_tools": ["iett_stops_search", "iett_next_arrivals"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_stops_search", "args": {"query": "Kavacık Köprüsü", "limit": 5}}, {"tool": "iett_next_arrivals", "args": {"line_code": "500T", "stop": "220641", "limit": 3}}], "expected_fields": ["iett_stops_search.data.stops[].stop_code", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].name", "iett_next_arrivals.data.line_code", "iett_next_arrivals.data.stop.stop_code", "iett_next_arrivals.data.disclaimer", "iett_next_arrivals.data.diagnostics.buses_received", "iett_next_arrivals.data.diagnostics.methods", "?iett_next_arrivals.data.arrivals[].eta_minutes", "?iett_next_arrivals.data.arrivals[].method", "?iett_next_arrivals.data.arrivals[].confidence", "?iett_next_arrivals.data.arrivals[].door_no"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "The arrival fields are optional on purpose: the recorded fixtures age past the 600 s freshness window of the ETA engine, so offline runs legitimately return zero arrivals and the harness marks those checks n/a instead of failing them. Live runs measure them."}
{"id": "j2-tr-2", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J2", "question": "500T Kadıköy'e ne zaman gelir?", "expected_tools": ["iett_stops_search", "iett_next_arrivals"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_stops_search", "args": {"query": "Kadıköy", "limit": 3}}, {"tool": "iett_next_arrivals", "args": {"line_code": "500T", "stop": "Kadıköy", "limit": 3}, "expect": "refusal", "error_contains": "uğramıyor"}], "expected_fields": ["iett_stops_search.data.stops[].stop_code", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].name"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "answer_must_contain_any": ["uğramıyor", "uğramaz", "geçmiyor", "does not serve", "does not stop"], "notes": "Doğrulanmış negatif senaryo: 500T Tuzla Şifa Mahallesi ile 4. Levent Metro arasında çalışır, Kadıköy'e uğramaz. Doğru davranış tahmin üretmek değil, reddetmek ve o durağa uğrayan hatları söylemektir. Uydurulmuş bir dakika buradaki en pahalı hata olur."}
{"id": "j2-en-2", "lang": "en", "journey": "J2", "question": "Does the 500T stop at Kadıköy Rıhtım (stop 401031)? How long until it arrives?", "expected_tools": ["iett_next_arrivals"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_next_arrivals", "args": {"line_code": "500T", "stop": "401031", "limit": 3}, "expect": "refusal", "error_contains": "uğramıyor"}], "expected_fields": [], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "answer_must_contain_any": ["uğramıyor", "uğramaz", "does not serve", "doesn't serve", "does not stop", "doesn't stop"], "notes": "Same refusal, addressed by stop code instead of name, in English. The tool answers in Turkish and names the lines that do serve the stop; the agent must translate the refusal, not soften it into an estimate."}
{"id": "j2-tr-3", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J2", "question": "Kozyatağı Metro durağının durak kodu ne?", "expected_tools": ["iett_stops_search"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_stops_search", "args": {"query": "Kozyatağı Metro", "limit": 5}}], "expected_fields": ["iett_stops_search.data.query", "iett_stops_search.data.count", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].stop_code", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].stop_id", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].name", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].lat", "iett_stops_search.data.stops[].lon"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Aynı ada sahip birden çok peron var; cevap tek bir kodu 'doğru kod' diye sunmamalı, yön bilgisiyle birlikte listelemeli."}
{"id": "j2-en-3", "lang": "en", "journey": "J2", "question": "Show me only the 500T buses heading towards 4.Levent Metro.", "expected_tools": ["iett_line_buses"], "calls": [{"tool": "iett_line_buses", "args": {"line_code": "500T", "direction": "4.LEVENT METRO"}}], "expected_fields": ["iett_line_buses.data.count", "iett_line_buses.data.directions", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].direction", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].door_no", "iett_line_buses.data.buses[].lat"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Direction filter. Every returned vehicle must carry the requested direction; a count that exceeds the unfiltered count would mean the filter was ignored."}
{"id": "j3-tr-1", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J3", "question": "M4'te arıza veya çalışma var mı?", "expected_tools": ["metro_status"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_status", "args": {"line": "M4"}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_status.data.count", "?metro_status.data.lines[].line_name", "?metro_status.data.lines[].description"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Metro İstanbul yalnızca duyurusu olan hatları döndürür. Boş liste 'veri yok' değil 'bildirilmiş arıza yok' demektir; araç bu ayrımı not alanından aktarmalı."}
{"id": "j3-en-1", "lang": "en", "journey": "J3", "question": "Is there a lift at Kartal metro station, and which line is it on?", "expected_tools": ["metro_station_info"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_station_info", "args": {"name": "Kartal"}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_station_info.data.count", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].name", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].line_name", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].lifts", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].escalators", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].wc", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].order"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Accessibility answer. The number of lifts is a facility count from GetStations, not a live availability signal — the answer must not claim a lift is working right now."}
{"id": "j3-tr-2", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J3", "question": "M7'de bir çalışma duyurusu var mı, seferler nasıl yapılıyor?", "expected_tools": ["metro_status"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_status", "args": {"line": "M7"}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_status.data.count", "?metro_status.data.lines[].description", "?metro_status.data.lines[].updated_at", "?metro_status.data.lines[].is_active"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "8 Eylül 2026'da M7'de aktarmalı sefer duyurusu vardı. Duyuru kalkarsa alanlar 'n/a' olur, senaryo hata vermez; duyuru varsa tarihi (updated_at) cevapta geçmeli çünkü Temmuz'dan kalma bir bildirim olabilir."}
{"id": "j3-en-2", "lang": "en", "journey": "J3", "question": "Which metro line serves 4.Levent, and does the station have step-free access?", "expected_tools": ["metro_station_info"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_station_info", "args": {"name": "4.Levent"}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_station_info.data.stations[].line_name", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].lifts", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].escalators", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].lat", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].lon"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "4.Levent is also the northern terminus of the 500T bus line, which is why it appears in both J2 and J3."}
{"id": "j3-tr-3", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J3", "question": "Üsküdar metro istasyonunda bebek bakım odası, WC ve mescit var mı?", "expected_tools": ["metro_station_info"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_station_info", "args": {"name": "Üsküdar"}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_station_info.data.stations[].name", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].baby_room", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].wc", "metro_station_info.data.stations[].masjid"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Boolean alanlar false olabilir; 'false' bir değerdir, eksik veri değildir. Cevap 'bebek odası yok' demeli, 'bilgi yok' dememeli."}
{"id": "j3-en-3", "lang": "en", "journey": "J3", "question": "Are there any metro disruptions right now, and how fresh is that information?", "expected_tools": ["metro_status", "city_freshness"], "calls": [{"tool": "metro_status", "args": {}}, {"tool": "city_freshness", "args": {}}], "expected_fields": ["metro_status.data.count", "city_freshness.data.sources.metro_status.age_seconds", "city_freshness.data.sources.metro_status.healthy", "city_freshness.data.checked_at", "city_freshness.data.attribution.en", "city_freshness.data.request_budget_remaining"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Freshness is part of the answer, not a footnote: a disruption notice can be weeks old while the read itself is seconds old, and the two ages must not be conflated."}
{"id": "j4-tr-1", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J4", "question": "Beşiktaş'ta hava kalitesi şu an nasıl?", "expected_tools": ["air_quality_now"], "calls": [{"tool": "air_quality_now", "args": {"place": "Beşiktaş"}}], "expected_fields": ["air_quality_now.data.place", "air_quality_now.data.station.name", "air_quality_now.data.station.station_id", "air_quality_now.data.station.distance_km", "air_quality_now.data.reading.read_time", "air_quality_now.data.disclaimer", "?air_quality_now.data.reading.pm10", "?air_quality_now.data.reading.aqi_index", "?air_quality_now.data.band.label"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "Ölçüm alanları isteğe bağlı işaretli: NO2/CO sık null gelir ve tek tek saatlerde PM10 da boş olabilir. En yakın istasyonun mesafesi cevapta olmalı, çünkü 'Beşiktaş'ta hava' aslında en yakın istasyonun ölçümüdür."}
{"id": "j4-en-1", "lang": "en", "journey": "J4", "question": "Is now a good time for a run in Kadıköy?", "expected_tools": ["air_quality_now", "air_quality_forecast"], "calls": [{"tool": "air_quality_now", "args": {"place": "Kadıköy"}}, {"tool": "air_quality_forecast", "args": {"place": "Kadıköy", "horizon_hours": 6}}], "expected_fields": ["air_quality_now.data.station.name", "air_quality_now.data.reading.read_time", "air_quality_now.data.disclaimer", "air_quality_forecast.data.available", "air_quality_forecast.data.horizon_hours", "air_quality_forecast.data.baseline_only", "air_quality_forecast.data.note", "?air_quality_forecast.data.forecast[].pm10", "?air_quality_forecast.data.forecast[].method", "?air_quality_forecast.data.best_window.at"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Two tools, one decision. The answer must carry the not-health-advice disclaimer and must not turn a seasonal-naive baseline into a recommendation stated as fact."}
{"id": "j4-tr-2", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J4", "question": "Maslak'ta hava kirliliği hangi seviyede, baskın kirletici ne?", "expected_tools": ["air_quality_now"], "calls": [{"tool": "air_quality_now", "args": {"place": "Maslak"}}], "expected_fields": ["air_quality_now.data.station.name", "air_quality_now.data.reading.read_time", "?air_quality_now.data.reading.dominant", "?air_quality_now.data.band.label", "?air_quality_now.data.reading.state"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "PM2.5 bu serviste yayımlanmıyor; 'baskın kirletici' yalnızca yayımlanan parametreler (PM10, SO2, O3, NO2, CO) arasından seçilir ve cevap bu sınırı söylemeli."}
{"id": "j4-en-2", "lang": "en", "journey": "J4", "question": "What will the air quality in Kadıköy be like 24 hours from now?", "expected_tools": ["air_quality_forecast"], "calls": [{"tool": "air_quality_forecast", "args": {"place": "Kadıköy", "horizon_hours": 24}}], "expected_fields": ["air_quality_forecast.data.horizon_hours == 24", "air_quality_forecast.data.baseline_only == true", "air_quality_forecast.data.forecast[].confidence == \"low\"", "air_quality_forecast.data.forecast[].method == \"seasonal_naive_24h\"", "air_quality_forecast.data.note"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "answer_must_contain_any": ["mevsimsel-naif", "temel model", "24 saat önceki", "baseline", "seasonal", "same hour yesterday", "yesterday", "düşük güven", "low confidence"], "notes": "Second honest-limits case. Beyond the baseline there is no model: every point is the value measured at the same hour yesterday, confidence low. The answer must say that, and must not present a 24-hour outlook as a forecast in the meteorological sense."}
{"id": "j4-tr-3", "lang": "tr", "journey": "J4", "question": "Bugün Beşiktaş'ta koşu için en temiz saat aralığı hangisi?", "expected_tools": ["air_quality_forecast"], "calls": [{"tool": "air_quality_forecast", "args": {"place": "Beşiktaş", "horizon_hours": 6}}], "expected_fields": ["air_quality_forecast.data.place", "air_quality_forecast.data.station.name", "air_quality_forecast.data.available", "air_quality_forecast.data.baseline_only", "air_quality_forecast.data.note", "?air_quality_forecast.data.best_window.at", "?air_quality_forecast.data.best_window.pm10", "?air_quality_forecast.data.latest.pm10"], "forbidden_phrases": ["kesinlikle", "garanti", "resmi", "kesin varış", "%100"], "notes": "'En iyi pencere' sıralaması saatlik PM10 derişimine göre yapılır; yayımlanan AQI, PM10 için 24 saatlik hareketli ortalamadır ve altı saatlik ufukta neredeyse hiç kıpırdamaz. Cevap hangi büyüklüğe baktığını söylemeli."}
{"id": "j4-en-3", "lang": "en", "journey": "J4", "question": "Which air-quality station is nearest to Sarıyer, and how old is its latest reading?", "expected_tools": ["places_resolve", "air_quality_now", "city_freshness"], "calls": [{"tool": "places_resolve", "args": {"query": "Sarıyer"}}, {"tool": "air_quality_now", "args": {"place": "Sarıyer"}}, {"tool": "city_freshness", "args": {}}], "expected_fields": ["places_resolve.data.matches[].name", "air_quality_now.data.station.name", "air_quality_now.data.station.distance_km", "air_quality_now.data.reading.read_time", "city_freshness.data.sources.aq_readings.age_seconds", "city_freshness.data.sources.aq_readings.healthy", "air_quality_now.provenance.reported_at", "air_quality_now.provenance.source_url"], "forbidden_phrases": ["guaranteed", "official", "certainly", "exactly on time", "100% accurate"], "notes": "Provenance-first question: the age quoted must be the reading's own timestamp, not the moment we fetched it. Readings land hourly, so a fresh fetch of an old hour is still an old measurement."}
